      "key": "mgba_idle_optimization",
      "label": "Idle Loop Removal",
      "info": "Reduce system load by optimizing so-called 'idle-loops' - sections in the code where nothing happens, but the CPU runs at full speed (like a car revving in neutral). Improves performance, and should be enabled on low-end hardware.",
